{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_heirloom","model_identifier":"trinket_heirloom","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_heirloom\n\nTrinket, heirloom.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.1..3.1, y -10.5..0.0, z -1.1..0.5 (size 6.2 x 10.5 x 1.6 u = 17 x 30 x 4 cm).\nHeirloom: an ornate oval locket (5 x 7.5 u) built from many tiny pieces: stepped body, a lattice-chased lid, a small red stone, four filigree curls at the shoulders, a bail and a drop, on a fine chain. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: gold. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_heirloom_copper.png`, `trinket_heirloom_tin.png`, `trinket_heirloom_bronze.png`, `trinket_heirloom_iron.png`, `trinket_heirloom_steel.png`, `trinket_heirloom_silver.png`, `trinket_heirloom_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_heirloom\n\nTrinket, heirloom.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -3.1..3.1, y -10.5..0.0, z -1.1..0.5 (size 6.2 x 10.5 x 1.6 u = 17 x 30 x 4 cm).\nHeirloom: an ornate oval locket (5 x 7.5 u) built from many tiny pieces: stepped body, a lattice-chased lid, a small red stone, four filigree curls at the shoulders, a bail and a drop, on a fine chain. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: gold. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_heirloom_copper.png`, `trinket_heirloom_tin.png`, `trinket_heirloom_bronze.pn